#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Use Simple Editor For Front Comments"
msgstr "访客评论使用简版编辑器"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Offers only bold, italic, strikethrough, blockquote, inline code, images and links in the visitor comment box — links and images are not clickable. The editor starts in single-column mode with a trimmed toolbar."
msgstr "访客评论区只提供粗体、斜体、删除线、引用、行内代码、图片与链接（链接与图片不可点击），编辑器默认单栏、工具栏精简。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Comment Syntax Limitation"
msgstr "评论语法的限制"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Comment syntax is limited by the WordPress KSES whitelist for untrusted content. Whether or not the simple editor is enabled, images, tables, headings, lists and horizontal rules may not display correctly in comments — some are stripped outright. The currently effective whitelist is listed under “Advanced Settings → Debugger”."
msgstr "评论区可用的语法受 WordPress 对不可信内容的 KSES 白名单限制。无论是否开启简版编辑器，图片、表格、多级标题、列表、分割线等在评论区的显示都可能受限（部分会被直接剥除）。当前实际生效的白名单见「高级设置 → 调试信息」。"

#: src/Front/FrontEditor.php
msgid "Supports **bold**, *italic*, ~~strikethrough~~, > quote, `code`, images and links (links and images are not clickable)"
msgstr "支持 **粗体**、*斜体*、~~删除线~~、> 引用、`代码`、图片与链接（链接与图片不可点击）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Comment HTML Whitelist (KSES)"
msgstr "评论区允许的 HTML 标签（KSES）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Comment Behavior Added By This Plugin"
msgstr "本插件对评论区新增的行为（非 WordPress 原生支持）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "(unavailable on this site)"
msgstr "（本站不可用）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "(no attribute)"
msgstr "（无属性）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "[WordPress native]"
msgstr "［WordPress 原生］"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "[added by this plugin]"
msgstr "［本插件扩展］"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "enabled"
msgstr "已开启"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "已关闭"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Images: WordPress does not allow <img> inside comments natively; this plugin adds it to the whitelist above. Current state: %s"
msgstr "图片：WordPress 原生不允许评论内嵌 <img>，是本插件把它加进了上面的白名单（非原生支持）。当前状态：%s"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Links: external links inside comments are degraded to read-only text and no <a> tag is produced. Current state: %s"
msgstr "链接：评论内的外链会被降级为只读文本，不生成 <a> 标签。当前状态：%s"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Degraded link output template: %s"
msgstr "链接降级后的输出模板：%s"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Comment body wrapper (%1$s) scopes image width and turns off emoji shortcodes inside comments. Current state: %2$s"
msgstr "评论正文容器（%1$s）：用于约束图片宽度，并关闭评论区的 emoji 短代码。当前状态：%2$s"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Formulas / task lists / code blocks / emoji inside comments are turned off. Current state: %s"
msgstr "评论区的公式 / 任务列表 / 代码块 / emoji 已关闭。当前状态：%s"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Currently confirmed to be fully compatible with the WordPress default themes. If it fails to load, please report it as soon as possible."
msgstr "目前已确认与 WordPress 默认主题完全兼容，如果加载失败请及时反馈！"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "I am the author of this modified / forked version. Compared with the original author's contribution, all I did was some minor fixes and small tweaks with little technical merit, so I did not add my own donation info. If you enjoy this modified WP-Editor.md, it would be great if you could visit my blog <a href=\"https://www.tjsky.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">秋风于渭水</a> when you have time. Thank you!"
msgstr "我是二次开发修改版的作者：和原作者的贡献比起来，我只是做了些没什么技术含量的小修小改，就不留捐赠信息了，如果修改版 WP-Editor.md 能得到你的喜爱，能有空来看看我的博客《<a href=\"https://www.tjsky.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">秋风于渭水</a>》就好啦，谢谢！"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Static Resource Integrity (integrity)"
msgstr "静态资源完整性校验（integrity）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Static Resource Integrity"
msgstr "静态资源完整性校验"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "Current resource address is on this site, so integrity is not required."
msgstr "当前资源地址在本站，无需配置完整性校验。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "%d integrity entries configured. Resources on another host are verified by the browser, and any mismatch is refused."
msgstr "已配置 %d 条完整性校验。别的主机提供的资源由浏览器核对指纹，对不上即拒绝加载。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "The resource address is on another host. Fill in the integrity values above."
msgstr "资源地址不在本站，请填写上方的完整性校验值。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "One entry per line, format: path=sha384-xxxx. The path is relative to the resource address above; a full URL is also accepted."
msgstr "每行一条，格式为「路径=sha384-xxxx」。路径相对于上面的资源地址，也可以直接填完整网址。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "A wrong CDN setting, or a compromised CDN, may inject malicious code into the JavaScript and CSS it serves. Please set the <code>integrity</code> attribute — how to set it up:"
msgstr "错误的CDN设置或遭到入侵的CDN可能在加载的JS、CSS内植入恶意代码，请设置 <code>integrity</code> 属性，设置方式见："

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "说明文档"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Fill in with the local files"
msgstr "用本机文件生成"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Not found locally, so skipped:"
msgstr "本机缺失、已跳过："

#: src/Utils/Settings/settings.js.php
msgid "Filled in %d entries — remember to save."
msgstr "已填入 %d 条，记得保存设置。"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "%d entries"
msgstr "%d 条"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Resource address"
msgstr "资源地址"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "[on another host — integrity is required]"
msgstr "【在别的主机，需要 integrity】"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "[on this site]"
msgstr "【在本站】"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Configured entries"
msgstr "已配置条目"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Verified on this page"
msgstr "本页已校验的资源"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Loaded from another host without integrity"
msgstr "来自别的主机、但未加 integrity 的资源"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Files used by this plugin that have no integrity entry"
msgstr "本插件会用到、但没有 integrity 条目的文件"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Image quality"
msgstr "图片清晰度"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Higher is sharper but larger. Only applies to images that need re-encoding."
msgstr "越高越清晰，文件也越大。只对需要重新编码的图片生效。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Keep transparent backgrounds"
msgstr "保留透明背景"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Pasted or dropped PNG, GIF and WebP images stay in their original format instead of being flattened onto white."
msgstr "粘贴或拖入的 PNG、GIF、WebP 图片保持原格式，不会被铺成白底。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Save uploaded images to the Media Library"
msgstr "自动存入媒体库"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Images you paste or drop are added to the Media Library, so you can find them later and reuse them elsewhere."
msgstr "粘贴或拖入的图片会加入媒体库，以后能在这里找到并重复使用。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Open Media Library after upload"
msgstr "上传后打开媒体库"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "The image goes straight into your post. Turn this on to also open the Media Library, so you can give it a title, description or alt text right away. Needs the option above."
msgstr "图片会直接插入正文。打开这一项后，会同时弹出媒体库，方便顺手补上标题、说明或替代文本。需要同时开启上一项。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Media Library"
msgstr "媒体库"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Keep images as they are"
msgstr "图像粘贴保持原格式"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Uploaded as-is: no re-encoding, no quality loss, transparent backgrounds preserved. Turn this off to compress new images into the format below."
msgstr "图片原样上传，不转码、不压缩，透明背景也保留。关掉这一项，才会按下面的格式压缩。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Compress images to"
msgstr "图片压缩转码格式"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "WebP is the smallest of the three at the same quality. JPG drops transparency; PNG stays lossless but largest."
msgstr "同样清晰度下 WebP 体积最小；JPG 不支持透明；PNG 无损但体积最大。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "This server cannot write WebP, so WebP is saved as JPG."
msgstr "这台服务器无法生成 WebP，选了会存成 JPG。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Compression quality"
msgstr "图片压缩率"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Lower means smaller files and less detail. Applies to JPG and WebP only."
msgstr "数值越低文件越小、细节越少。只对 JPG 和 WebP 生效。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Image Settings"
msgstr "图片设置"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Turns shortcuts like :smile: into emoji images on the published page. Emoji you type or paste yourself (😄) display normally either way — this option does not affect them."
msgstr "把 :smile: 这类短代码在文章页转成 Emoji 图片。你自己输入或粘贴的 Emoji 字符（如 😄）本来就能正常显示，不受这一项影响。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Your images are still compressed to JPG."
msgstr "你的图片目前仍会压缩成 JPG。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "WebP looks the same or better at roughly half the size, and every browser released in the last few years can display it. You can switch the format in Image Settings."
msgstr "在体积约为一半的情况下，WebP 的画质与 JPG 相当甚至更好，近几年发布的浏览器都能显示。你可以在「图片设置」里换过去。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Switch to WebP"
msgstr "换成 WebP"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Don't show this again"
msgstr "不再提示"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "Done. New images will be saved as WebP."
msgstr "已切换，新上传的图片会存成 WebP。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php src/Admin/Controller.php
msgid "You are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "你没有权限执行此操作。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "The box below can stay empty."
msgstr "下面的输入框可以留空。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "%d integrity entries are computed from this version's files. Nothing to do after an upgrade."
msgstr "已按本版资源自动算出 %d 条校验值，升级后无需处理。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "The values saved below were made for another version. The plugin is using the ones it computed itself — save them here to clean up."
msgstr "下面保存的校验值来自其他版本。当前用的是插件自己算出的值；保存一次即可把它们替换成本版的。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "The box below is optional: fill it in only if your resource package differs from the bundled files. Format: path=sha384-xxxx."
msgstr "下面的输入框是可选的：只在你换了自己的资源包时才需要填。格式：路径=sha384-xxxx。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "Cannot read the bundled resource files, so integrity is disabled. Upload the resource package again."
msgstr "读不到插件自带的资源文件，完整性校验暂不可用。请重新上传资源包。"

#: src/Utils/AssetsIntegrity.php
msgid "The resource package is incomplete, so integrity cannot be computed. Re-upload the resource package, or point the address back to the plugin folder."
msgstr "资源包不完整，无法计算校验值。请重新上传资源包，或把资源地址改回插件目录。"
